      "commit_sha": "583274035a2a577bd6954bef9872615dce0beebc",
      "commit_message": "Install Vercel Web Analytics\n\nImplemented Vercel Web Analytics for the Stash Money Manager project.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### 1. Package Installation\n- Installed `@vercel/analytics` version 2.0.1 using npm\n- Package added to dependencies in package.json\n\n### 2. Analytics Integration\n- Modified `src/app/layout.tsx` to integrate Vercel Web Analytics\n- Added import: `import { Analytics } from '@vercel/analytics/next';`\n- Added `<Analytics />` component inside the `<body>` tag, positioned after the `<Footer />` component\n\n### Files Modified\n- `package.json` - Added @vercel/analytics dependency\n- `package-lock.json` - Updated with new dependency tree\n- `src/app/layout.tsx` - Added Analytics import and component\n\n## Implementation Details\n\nFollowing the official Vercel documentation (https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart), the Analytics component was added to the root layout file for Next.js App Router. This is the recommended approach for Next.js 13+ applications using the app directory.\n\nThe `<Analytics />` component was placed at the end of the `<body>` tag to:\n- Ensure analytics tracking loads after the main content\n- Maintain optimal page performance\n- Follow Vercel's recommended implementation pattern\n\n## Verification\n\n- TypeScript compilation: ✓ Successful (compiled successfully in 5.5s)\n- Linting: ✓ Passed with 0 errors (only pre-existing warnings unrelated to this change)\n- Build process: TypeScript and webpack compilation completed successfully\n  (Note: Full build requires Supabase environment variables which are deployment-specific)\n\n## Next Steps for Deployment\n\nTo enable analytics data collection:\n1. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard (Analytics → Enable)\n2. Deploy the application to Vercel\n3. Analytics will automatically begin tracking page views and web vitals\n4. Data will be available in the Vercel dashboard after deployment\n\nThe implementation is complete and ready for deployment.\n\nCo-authored-by: Vercel <vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
